          "text": "Right wrist and thumb movement"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Fine crepitus felt on active thumb movement at the wrist. Wrist range of motion near full, with mild pain on ulnar deviation. Thumb abduction and extension limited by pain."
      }
    },
